window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"<i>Turned </i>is a book to rival <i>Twilight </i>and <i>Vampire Diaries</i>, and one that will have you wanting to keep reading until the very last page! If you are into adventure, love and vampires this book is the one for you!\" (Vampirebooksite.com)</p> <p>This 3,500-word piece is a never-before-seen chapter from <i>Turned </i>(book one in the Vampire Journals), a free download and the number one best seller, with over 500 five-star reviews on Amazon! It provides an alternate ending to the series, ending the series with Jonah’s point of view. It offers a whole new perspective on how <i>Turned </i>may have ended.</p> <p>Books one to 11 in the Vampire Journals are also available!</p> <p>\"<i>Turned </i>is an ideal story for young readers. Morgan Rice did a good job spinning an interesting twist on what could have been a typical vampire tale. Refreshing and unique, <i>Turned</i> has the classic elements found in many Young Adult paranormal stories. Book #1 of the Vampire Journals Series focuses around one girl...one extraordinary girl!\" (<i>The Romance Reviews</i>)</p> <p>\"<i>Turned </i>grabbed my attention from the beginning and did not let go.... This story is an amazing adventure that is fast paced and action packed from the very beginning. There is not a dull moment to be found.\" (Paranormal Romance Guild)</p>"; 
